# Keep the build context lean. The image needs Python sources + the
# lockfile for the API/agents/engine/broker packages, AND the JS sources
# for apps/mobile + packages/ui + packages/shared-types (the web-builder
# stage exports the web UI from these). Everything below is either huge,
# local-only, or secret-bearing regardless of which stage would use it —
# **/node_modules and **/.expo already cover the JS packages' own build
# caches, so there's no need to exclude those package directories wholesale.
.git
.venv
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.expo
**/.expo
**/dist
.env
**/.env
*.md
.claude
.DS_Store
